{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e1781c4ea5b05404605e672473b1c05701a19f977429bdac83c0a1c420c2c40a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:751b626775941ec0c5a2214966e78cf5491300d87f09ea69395badf7ba0f8b88",
      "text": "迈出一步",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:473ebee4637fa9ab2adf1a3ebb06cf4fdc63129cfd6376cb65ea317fa17f3a74",
      "text": "咲收到了来自服装品牌的合作邀请。\n为了市场调查，咲要和女孩子们进行\n焦点小组访谈。\n面对满场女性咲感到有些紧张，\n但以“可爱”一词为契机逐渐敞开了心扉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000009:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000009:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:751b626775941ec0c5a2214966e78cf5491300d87f09ea69395badf7ba0f8b88",
      "text": "迈出一步",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2493ca96619ba319218bdab871c946626e0c86f47e209a0cfe9da7fe6792e136",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，早上好～☆\n呐，要谈的工作是什么什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d8ba9beed83823bed9dab408e903778cefd03755e53182d27c509d3b575d772",
      "text": "服装品牌向咲先生\n发来了联名合作的邀请！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a096cc877fd08158a392b2a5f0adeb1e58b73c090061a1317067a82e6ecde958",
      "text": "服装品牌！那难不成……\n咲酱终于要作为设计师出道了！？开玩笑的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a68f63b3fbaddaf9b368cdb4181f7787f01d35b1a75473c89cac02df270cc4b",
      "text": "猜对了！\n委托的内容是设计连衣裙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbe4a5d0655d64ebcb1d058602a2d22c916e968088c793aadb3d66875c1d63ea",
      "text": "哎！真的假的！？\n虽然很吃惊，但是超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c05c78691291823799a74d3d819c65b7a1c599cfb60bb857659838fc0fd5b327",
      "text": "对方说希望能做出一款\n具有咲先生风格的设计哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bd12ab341b36498b78501f482458aefcf8c5ec82d8ba6e08e33216ff0143aed",
      "text": "交给我吧！我会构思出充满我个人风格、\n让穿上的人全都啪噼变得超可爱的衣服的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13c3ad48da6bfea902dc9794036e7435b6c1e9ceaf9dff5a2b0de4b38e2e12bd",
      "text": "但是但是，可爱也有很多种呢。\n要弄成什么样的可爱呢。好纠结～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb7d18095dc316e6c05ecdafdf3462cdc0b9c6959c036f18b66dd1a879a7c42d",
      "text": "既然如此，兼顾市场调查，找目标客户层的女孩子们\n做个焦点小组访谈怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d6962459f7025b30469fc76f41ede8e78d5514e9584aef5c9aab4911f5db2f1",
      "text": "焦点小组访谈啊。\n感觉能浮现出好点子，但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a42bc3f29cafe22ca90c2e136973e0631f84d50aacb2ef8864e467c3681c2fb",
      "text": "就是要和女孩子们聊天对吧。\n那肯定是由我去聊对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8b13b1f06bdb5f55f1cae24f1f94a964d479e2e13bb7a1821d5d02aa7f3363d",
      "text": "是的，我和品牌方的人也会列席，不过……\n咲先生似乎有什么顾虑呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7f870f48b6dd76780b0b9f8db7fedf4799cc490ef7bc7a93c825f98d01e4e27",
      "text": "嗯……我跟女孩子聊天的话，\n会觉得很紧张呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c23bcf5bdac179a1b8ebfa11249d4cb726a943e2a0ceefda1d600f5976a36ab",
      "text": "可能会搞砸的……\n我真的能好好完成采访吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4916b958d964900ad933ecee72915b397e9e2b098274e123544cd7fb674f44d1",
      "text": "没事的。我也会从旁协助。\n一定会是一段愉快的时光的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1918a4a9c0120d8e6a29a277fb6907fc4a1e3053cafc5cdab30c4c372b517df",
      "text": "而且，这次工作能够实现，\n也是多亏了那些“女孩子们”哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8630eef8b6e90002a7997333b434e0ea05e9d6be49b0c965e015c5cc1e59c03e",
      "text": "女孩子们的……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb97fe0ab48134b9a6969acc79c4352c7a4563caf90ca2504397437e4e2e98b",
      "text": "是的。据说崇拜咲先生的女孩子们的心声，\n大量传达到了服装品牌那里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cbc6839dbecf72b44292b0683f0c788efad9362a32cf2805b4cdf07a22c559f",
      "text": "为了回应她们的支持，\n这次的工作，我们一起努力吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cf78f54eb7ec8d9bb2638b08481bf451133e2b5d8e1b9abc95143a9e2f87c5c",
      "text": "……嗯，我知道了。我干！\n为了大家的“可爱”，我要全力以赴啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_c:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5abb7839b6d2aff83fa956453c1c47a9e67d535a97489eeed18f176a4a585348",
      "text": "访谈当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_c:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78ab86358eb02ccb4078c3d4db639a1a4d5489962b0852520b8bea3a6de233a3",
      "text": "访谈室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d28cdd508181291d338cfa0d1e9f4facd4f4a01a35433b594122551cbfa994b",
      "text": "（哇哇，从中学生到大学生、\n还有社会人，好多人啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed16a38918fb59d25a486a02b499a386e6537197156f9c3913306e7b76a33bdf",
      "text": "（大家都好时尚，超级可爱！……可是，\n在女孩子面前，果然还是好紧张……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17c6fcec12a1f7f6f21bd33ec27e1d71f0c4ac4d85a4d27033471f044e4aca5d",
      "text": "那个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32eafa8ed5c6c86d6dd23437d7a07e58c553211a8949fffdb9b3fff0786a422f",
      "text": "（咲先生好像放不开。这时候由我来……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:017fad64d85dc9cffaa42a24d37e14f886204f25e423dcf97abc28289d5bbec8",
      "text": "那么我们就立刻开始吧。\n首先大家互相做个自我介绍好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3424395c9d1309b8d06a8a7b05e1694da8d6be017cb85ed40bfcd332a755101",
      "text": "啊，对哦。太紧张了，都还没自我介绍呢。\n……好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2fa91ae99ee99b9390dc14e42ba6de133ee574c2e82d53675cbf9e7e2970e1f",
      "text": "我是水岛咲。大家叫我咲就可以啦！\n各位，今天请多关照☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:694d5c01bec6926512318fd806f45ee7c555ab166dfeac5da906149f4c715de1",
      "text": "咲酱……真人、好可爱……！\n请、请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96df96b75d7b63834f3ac76fdb596a74624f670682042846eba84f5a2d9d861c",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿……谢谢——！\n超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3ec7c7b02bd65c7f86e79392501a86bc170f024c1f104c994e08c66fb411558",
      "text": "（……太好了。看来稍微进入状态了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1bb359dbf54561cb30307e85fb1a38a2c49abfb530b3f04cd5fcc59db7cfa58",
      "text": "原来大学里流行那种美妆啊！\n很有成熟感，但是但是又好可爱☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60be6781343ac646ccee42447d87a3d9c0e8aa72b5eb3e24bba85362fed89614",
      "text": "嗯嗯，平时方不方便穿用果然很重要呢。\n那样的话，颜色和花纹就设计成这种感觉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aaaa186a023768a77d65393966f7c930c9af62bf836c5cc5bd312f2c4c26857",
      "text": "……啊！那款美妆，我们高中也超有人气的！\n我也有哦。啪噼地撞款了呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af73fff8ca383d1791847c692cf313a8005a2e42c1cadd33f5fc050b022d701f",
      "text": "（咲先生聊得也很投机呢。太好了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15d92a09a879166ef3f8f58d4d758cc74dd21c60f86c779fa7be05d649bd2fc8",
      "text": "（这样的话，一定能构思出\n很棒的设计……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000065:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:934c914903ad2a12e920d456bcc35a652c8d787868a84b056837b150480f8bcc",
      "text": "各位，今天真的很感谢大家。\n能聊这么多话题，超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c92fd1d1ee041cc98281d498b93bafa828316c765d7b53e7561dfebd6d92b802",
      "text": "多亏了大家，我想到了很多好点子哦。\n大家敬请期待成品的出炉吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31a78f41b12b3da67526f255659dad947b641153b3429534d900e5416d08eba3",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n聊得非常热烈呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcf81188456bf5d07701fca8e746362ebcf6b080936d748ea10216fb3de2c19c",
      "text": "嗯！一开始虽然很紧张，\n但聊开之后时间一下子就过去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:386056972a30c98c07947ca4226e50aaac7d0600c20c182bd5f8fb6409a161cf",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿。\n和大家一起分享“可爱”，真美好呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "数周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91d3d475fb76a56441cdd0a28ddcd68a6c66873b3bf59a56bef63011ba25ee44",
      "text": "前几天的联名连衣裙，\n似乎非常受好评呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a6266ac0f0d8e3134ef52649c6bcff58865fd63cbb75f9b28a89957f31485c2",
      "text": "嗯！日常好穿又能经常搭，\n社交网络上的评价也超好呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa10ffaa7a4efbf2bf8ab8f7531a20177d8a78df3f1d58a81ef686140738776f",
      "text": "我说不定很有当设计师的\n潜质？开玩笑的啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05bd6bc9dbd0a6d3e8a4e396a7e3d91474eaac5ce5464376149cdba244c4994d",
      "text": "那件连衣裙非常突显咲先生的风格，\n我也觉得棒极了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab8df8a112dbf3f22c4d65a7add4cfecd541847729a5ce26fd24c712dc278d2c",
      "text": "谢谢——♪设计能这么顺利，\n多亏了●●●●プロデューサー哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7eb2d73bdd0240df6c65efc4a7a81b63fd18b3de5c36ad6f40af20344624e118",
      "text": "要是没有那次焦点小组访谈，\n也不会诞生出这么多灵感……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f790cce06d79e1ddd4bce5af650f3e4a6c4de9d0b654c6ab851c59172d3f96fb",
      "text": "是因为有●●●●プロデューサー在旁边照应，\n我才能好好跟她们搭上话的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78665c7771c2300cc172e6271da0c058c7a1c421b2c62a51aae724b91011e3f8",
      "text": "虽然跟女孩子说话果然还是会紧张……\n但下次说不定能由我自己主动搭话了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4524f8254939b9551f027ad19bc6e0ff220558dccc99480703761cd99e966e8f",
      "text": "能帮上咲先生的忙真是太好了。\n接下来的工作，我们也一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f9c8d68198962cebf02903189b5b9585c2539534b7195f6f2cc41638947daba",
      "text": "嗯！今后也请多多关照我哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
